  "titleEn": "With Apologies to Robert Frost",
  "titleEs": "Con permiso de Robert Frost",
  "titleText": {
    "es": "Unos dicen que el mundo acabará con fuego; otros dicen que con segfaults.",
    "en": "Some say the world will end in fire; some say in segfaults.",
    "noteEn": "A segfault, short for segmentation fault, is a program crash caused by invalid memory access. The line replaces the ice in Robert Frost's poem with a programming failure."
  },
